  "details": "Invites expire 15 minutes after they are sent within the VRChat environment\n\nVRCX allows someone to join whenever they want, if they were invited at all\n\nI don't want someone to join me an hour later after I had already given up on them showing up\n\nEither VRCX needs to disable this feature, or VRChat needs to block them by forcing the invite link to expire as expected after 15 minutes\n\nIf you couldn't be bothered to join me within 15 minutes, then you don't deserve to continue to have access to joining me an hour later\n\nToo many people are too stupid to be respectful about this, so I think VRChat should force VRCX to disable this feature either by demand or by breaking it by changing how their API responds to it\n\nYou don't need infinite time to join your \"friends\" you need to show up when you're invited\n\nIf you can't show up on time, then you shouldn't visit at all",
